				"Some of the old world would rather join you than eat you."
				""
				"\u00a7aTameable Beasts\u00a7r: penguins, raccoons, geckos, giant beetles, argentavis, quetzalcoatlus."
				"\u00a7dTiny Dragons\u00a7r: pocket-sized companions with real firepower."
				""
				"Start by getting your hands on any creature egg. Steal it, trade for it, find it; the book does not judge."
